cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Vehicle Overtaking Tracker: An Automated Overtaking Event Detection System"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fenggroup/vehicle-overtaking-tracker"
authors:
  - family-names: "Padmanaban"
    given-names: "Gandhimathi"
  - family-names: "Moustafa"
    given-names: "Rayane"
  - family-names: "Feng"
    given-names: "Fred"
abstract: >
  A computer vision system for detecting and analyzing vehicle overtaking events
  from bicycle-mounted camera image sequences. Combines RT-DETR object detection
  with ByteTrack multi-object tracking and geometry-based validation to identify
  and record passing events.
keywords:
  - computer vision
  - vehicle detection
  - object tracking
  - bicycle safety
  - RT-DETR
  - ByteTrack
